OL,3,GNEWSA84-year-old woman seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 84-year-old woman has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after a crash
OL,8,Fin an East Yorkshire village.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to the junction of Cave Road and
OL,12,FBrantingham Road in Ellerker at about
OL,13,F17:20 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FThe collision involved the woman, who
OL,16,Fwas a pedestrian, and a blue
OL,17,FVolkswagen, which was travelling from
OL,18,Fthe direction of Cave Road, the force
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,21,FThe woman was taken to hospital with
OL,22,Fher injuries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
